  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 2 Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - 'Great! Now that we have the initial EMBEDDING, it is time to build the core
    of the transformer model:


    The ATTENTION mechanism.'
  - 'To start, we''ll need three different versions of our starting EMBEDDING: One
    for the QUERY, one for the KEY, and one for the VALUE embeddings. Be sure to
    use the right weights for each of the embeddings (you can change the weights
    by clicking on a network factory outside of build mode).'
  - The activation function of the networks should also be set to ReLU!
  - 'When the embeddings have been made, multiply the QUERY and KEY embeddings together
    (you''ll need to transpose the KEY embedding to make the multiplication work). '
  - 'The result of the multiplication can then be SCALED based on the dimensions
    of the matrix and put through a SOFTMAX.


    The created EMBEDDING represents
    how strong each token correlates to each other token.'
  - Finally, you can multiply that EMBEDDING with the VALUE matrix to create the
    final output of the ATTENTION mechanism.
